<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CBANK SETS 1-WK REV REPO, LIMIT RATE 14.5PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH CBANK SETS 1-WK REV REPO, LIMIT RATE 14.5PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Thursday set a one-week reverse repo tender to drain liquidity with a limit rate of 14.5 percent, unchanged from a similar operation on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The CNB added that average and maximum yield in a two week reverse repo operation was 14.5 percent at which all bids were accepted.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
